      "start_line": 205,
      "end_line": 210,
      "source": "        public Builder dependencies(List<AggregateReference<SemanticData, UUID>> dependencies) {\n            this.dependencies = dependencies.stream()\n                    .map(SemanticDataDependency::new)\n                    .toList();\n            return this;\n        }\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "packages/sirius-web/backend/sirius-web-domain/src/main/java/org/eclipse/sirius/web/domain/boundedcontexts/semanticdata/SemanticData.java",
      "sha256": "cf019f0abe58095c8cf3c6d5ffdc80e43b7823a4464e85f40c2467e8a71fb4e0",
      "declaration": "public SemanticData build",
      "start_line": 212,
      "end_line": 227,
      "source": "        public SemanticData build(ICause cause) {\n            var semanticData = new SemanticData();\n\n            semanticData.isNew = true;\n            semanticData.id = UUID.randomUUID();\n            semanticData.documents = Objects.requireNonNull(this.documents);\n            semanticData.domains = Objects.requireNonNull(this.domains);\n            semanticData.dependencies = Objects.requireNonNull(this.dependencies);\n\n            var now = Instant.now();\n            semanticData.createdOn = now;\n            semanticData.lastModifiedOn = now;\n\n            semanticData.registerEvent(new SemanticDataCreatedEvent(UUID.randomUUID(), now, cause, semanticData));\n            return semanticData;\n        }\n"
    }
  ],
  "identity_contract": "Document.java class has no equals/hashCode override; set equality is object identity. Caller supplies observed iteration order. AggregateReference equality is injected separately; not inferred from getId.",
  "mutation_admission": "Operation-specific list capability must be supplied. addAll is skipped when no new dependencies exist; removeIf is always invoked. Rejected/unresolved invocation produces no successful effect plan."
}
